  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarships,Technical and Institutional Capacity Building at Garoua Wildlife College,..Cameroon, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modification 1: his modification is intended to continue support to Garoua Wildlife College in Cameroon by enhancing the Colleges ability to deliver effective conservation training programs for Francophone Africa. Specific activities include: (1) provision of training scholarships for candidates from Central Africa to develop their capacity on conservation and protected area management; and (2) strengthening of the facultys capabilities to conduct training and research on threats facing wildlife and the implementation of results-based conservation actions.</narrative>
  </description>
